Third-party data notice:
The bundled sample images (data/samples/) are drawn from the HRSID_OPENSSDD
dataset (a merge of HRSID and SSDD/OpenSARShip, exported via Roboflow), which
are publicly released academic SAR ship-detection datasets. They remain the
property of their respective authors and are included here solely for
demonstration. See prd.md §9 for dataset details and citation requirements.
The pretrained demo weight (weights/best.pt) originates from the open-source
project github.com/sethubolt7/YOLOV8_SAR_SHIP_DETECTION.
